{"id":"habitante","lemma":"habitante","pos":"adj","rank":3595,"glosses":["inhabiting; said of something that inhabits"],"ipa":"/abiˈtante/","forms":{"femininePlural":"habitantes"},"order":3598,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/55/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-habitante.wav","examples":[{"text":"El pueblo tenía más de mil habitantes.","en":"The village had more than a thousand inhabitants.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693987","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"town, village"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"thousand"},null]},{"text":"La ciudad tiene muchos habitantes.","en":"The city has a large population.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"city"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},null]},{"text":"Los habitantes de la isla son amigables.","en":"The inhabitants of the island are friendly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692704","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,null,null,{"g":"island"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"amicable","l":"amigable"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]}]}